OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FDry this
OL,6,Fevening with some sunny spells and
OL,7,Fremaining dry overnight with clear
OL,8,Fspells. Variable amounts of cloud,
OL,9,Fmainly in the west and light winds for
OL,10,Fall.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FDry with settled conditions
OL,13,Facross the region. Any early morning
OL,14,Fcloud will lift leaving behind plenty
OL,15,Fof late July sunshine. Feeling
OL,16,Fincreasingly very warm and locally hot
OL,17,Fin places.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
